+<tr><td>packages/shared suite by cell name: <strong>54 files / 1034 cells, 1 failed</strong> at the base; <strong>55 files / 1047 cells, 1 failed</strong> with the change; 0 vanished, 13 new, 0 changed status. The one failure is the <code>wallet-signature.test.ts</code> cell that fails on Node 26 because <code>cbor.encode</code> truncates its output to one byte there (KS 1727, KS 1739). A first full run under machine load 10 also timed out three unrelated cells (8 s, 47 s and 90 s); the same three files pass 108 / 108 alone, the slowest cell taking 3.8 s, and the repeat full run was clean. The clean run is the one quoted.</td></tr>
